# Wave T30 (Wildflower kit): petalfloor — Wildflower's registered
# street kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix;
# the desire-path tiers key on it). PETAL-FLECKED GARDEN LANE:
# pale cream gravel in the path family, fine pebble speckle, strewn
# with fallen petals — rose, white and gold flecks laid as a loose
# scatter, drifting denser along the lee edge. Structurally a loose
# organic scatter on fine gravel: unlike Lilac's bronze lattice
# grid, Fairhaven's running-bond quay slabs, Copperton's square
# quarry flags, Mistford's long timber planks. (NO-SAME-KIT law;
# WAVE-T30-WILDFLOWER-PLAN.md.)
